{"3930650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dream Liminal ", "steam_appid": 3930650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You go to bed at night, but wake up in a place where everything feels both familiar and unsettling. You must find a way to escape… or is it all just a dream?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore over 50+ levels alone or with your friends.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make last minute decisions</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you go left or right? Each path leads to a different possibility of getting out. Will you take your friend with you, or will you both go separate ways?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What’s your favorite aesthetic—dreamcore, liminal spaces, or Frutiger Aero?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ve created all of them. You can explore liminal places that feel strangely familiar, wander through unsettling dreamcore worlds where something feels off, or step into the Frutiger future we were promised but never received.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You go to bed at night, but wake up in a place where everything feels both familiar and unsettling. You must find a way to escape… or is it all just a dream?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore over 50+ levels alone or with your friends.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make last minute decisions</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you go left or right? Each path leads to a different possibility of getting out. Will you take your friend with you, or will you both go separate ways?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What’s your favorite aesthetic—dreamcore, liminal spaces, or Frutiger Aero?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’ve created all of them. You can explore liminal places that feel strangely familiar, wander through unsettling dreamcore worlds where something feels off, or step into the Frutiger future we were promised but never received.</p>", "short_description": "A single-player and multiplayer experience exploring liminal spaces, dreamcore, and Frutiger Aero aesthetics.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930650/e3e1d6d62af16057520921ddc3634e34ea508104/header.jpg?t=1758650958", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930650/36c0509caa83ae89ff7a6a37796303800d1eb020/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758650958", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930650/36c0509caa83ae89ff7a6a37796303800d1eb020/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758650958", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 or AMD RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br><